# Build context for web/Dockerfile.
#
# The repo-root .dockerignore does NOT apply here — Docker reads the
# .dockerignore at the root of the build CONTEXT, and Coolify builds this app
# with `web` as its base directory. (The root one excludes `web` outright, to
# keep the voice-pipeline context small; see the note in web/Dockerfile.)
#
# Effect: 838MB context down to ~2.7MB, so the daemon is not handed 835MB of
# node_modules it is about to discard and reinstall from the lockfile anyway.

node_modules
.next
out

# Never let a local env file reach a build layer. Everything this app needs is
# passed as a build ARG, and a .env copied in here would both override those
# and persist in the image history where `docker history` can read it.
.env
.env.*

.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
